{"parentUuid":"2a67af75-df21-402c-b790-8db872963528","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyPPkWdGoEWTK6Y2xZ8R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're describing three scopes: a step, a workflow (all its steps), and all workflows. Each one enables or disables rules. Today a rule applies at \"every step\" or at a named list of steps. It can't apply to one workflow, and it can't be turned off in one place while it stays on elsewhere. So this needs a new model, not only a new view, and three choices shape it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":697351,"output_tokens":2242,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":950},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2242,"cache_read_input_tokens":697351,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"727074e3-bbfe-477b-b4f8-cd04c2ee7086","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgyPPDx6grz2F9on3A8GM","type":"assistant","uuid":"4424a316-3ee4-4e51-a794-3048141856cc","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:57:05.200Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"4424a316-3ee4-4e51-a794-3048141856cc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyPPkWdGoEWTK6Y2xZ8R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DE2BxHZqTUD2PpL8NApsjE","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"How should the three scopes combine?","header":"Model","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Inherit with overrides (Recommended)","description":"Each constraint or grant is one item. At every scope it is Inherit, On or Off. The most specific setting wins: step over workflow over all workflows. So a rule can be on for all workflows, off for one workflow, and on again for one of its steps.","preview":"Keep shell use small\n  All workflows   [On]\n  Bug fix         [Inherit → on]\n  Bug fix/build   [Off]        ← wins at build\n\nResult: on everywhere except Bug fix's build step."},{"label":"Only add, never remove","description":"A scope can only turn items on. An item is on at a step if it is on for all workflows, its workflow, or the step. Simpler, but you can't exempt one workflow or step from a rule that is on for all."}]},{"question":"Where should the scopes sit in the UI?","header":"View","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Breadcrumb levels (Recommended)","description":"The Workflows page gets a level bar: All workflows › Bug fix › build. Each level shows the same Rules view (charter, harness, factory) with an Inherit | On | Off switch per item. Picking a workflow in the list shows its level; picking a step on the canvas shows the step's.","preview":"Workflows\n[All workflows] › [Bug fix] › [build]\n┌ canvas ──────────────────────┐\n│ [plan] ──▶ [build]           │\n└────────────────────────────┘\nRules at Bug fix (all its steps)\n HARNESS\n  Keep shell use small  [Inherit|On|Off] on\n  sandbox::*            [Inherit|On|Off] on"},{"label":"Overview page plus editor","description":"Workflows opens to an overview: every workflow as a row with its rules, plus an 'All workflows' rules section. Clicking a workflow opens the canvas editor, where its workflow-level rules and its steps' rules live."}]},{"question":"Does a rule's rung (told, checked, enforced; ask, allowed) belong to the item, or to each scope?","header":"Rung","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"To the item (Recommended)","description":"A rule has one rung everywhere; scopes only turn it on or off. One place to promote or demote it, and the audit stays simple."},{"label":"To each scope","description":"A scope may set its own rung, e.g. enforced for all workflows but only told in one workflow. More power, more to read at each level."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_read_input_tokens":697351,"output_tokens":2242,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":950},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2242,"cache_read_input_tokens":697351,"cache_creation_input_tokens":255,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":255},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01DE2BxHZqTUD2PpL8NApsjE":{"questions":[{"question":"How should the three scopes combine?","header":"Model","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Inherit with overrides (Recommended)","description":"Each constraint or grant is one item. At every scope it is Inherit, On or Off. The most specific setting wins: step over workflow over all workflows. So a rule can be on for all workflows, off for one workflow, and on again for one of its steps.","preview":"Keep shell use small\n  All workflows   