{"parentUuid":"b3d5da8d-7d37-468c-89b9-b8027f668478","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgyb9EcHpeXo1AgEdfPyz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01T97rzf1J5RnoiKzc76LpuV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/step_rules/constraints.rs'; s=open(p).read()\nold='''    let owned = editable && c.source != \"charter\";\n    if owned && c.reviewer.is_empty() {\n        line = line.push(small(\"Form\", Some(Msg::Form(c.id.clone(), None))));\n    }\n    if editable && removable(c, at) {\n        line = line.push(small(\"Remove\", Some(Msg::Remove(c.id.clone()))));\n    }\n    match rules.forming.as_ref().filter(|d| d.id == c.id) {'''\nnew='''    line = line.extend(actions(c, at, editable));\n    match rules.forming.as_ref().filter(|d| d.id == c.id) {'''\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold='''fn line<'a>(rules: &Rules, c: &ConstraintView, at: &At, editable: bool) -> Element<'a, Msg> {'''\nnew='''/// A row's buttons: Form for a rule the owner keeps, and Remove where it\n/// may come off whole.\nfn actions<'a>(c: &ConstraintView, at: &At, editable: bool) -> Vec<Element<'a, Msg>> {\n    let formed = editable && c.source != \"charter\" && c.reviewer.is_empty();\n    let form = formed.then(|| small(\"Form\", Some(Msg::Form(c.id.clone(), None))));\n    let remove = (editable && removable(c, at)).then(|| small(\"Remove\", Some(Msg::Remove(c.id.clone()))));\n    form.into_iter().chain(remove).collect()\n}\n\nfn line<'a>(rules: &Rules, c: &ConstraintView, at: &At, editable: bool) -> Element<'a, Msg> {'''\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nCARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 cargo fmt --all; CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0 sh -c 'cargo clippy -p bastion-desktop --all-targets -- -D warnings 2>&1 | grep -E \"^error\" -A10 | head; cargo test -p bastion-desktop 2>&1 | grep -E \"test result|panicked\" | head -2'","description":"Move the 