{"parentUuid":"c614ec4c-d293-47ba-bc9f-fd3a573e2094","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgycYWod78PMw1jwVHHer","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ENaQpb4NgQa4TX2wj3yTbF","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"Does Bastion still apply the charter (the repository's deny rules and hooks), or only show it?","header":"Charter","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Only show it","description":"Bastion stops applying the repository's permissions and hooks; only Bastion's own rules govern a job. The charter becomes a read-only view of what the repository holds. The agent may still read AGENTS.md as part of the repository.","preview":"Settings › Workspaces › demo-local\n  Charter (read-only, from the repository)\n    AGENTS.md\n    .agents/settings.json: denies Bash(git push:*)\n    .agents/agents: strict\n  Bastion does not apply it."},{"label":"Show it and keep applying it","description":"The charter moves out of the rules pages to a workspace view, but the gate still refuses what the repository denies and runs its hooks."}]},{"question":"Where should the charter view live?","header":"Charter view","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Settings › Workspaces (Recommended)","description":"Each workspace in Settings shows its charter: AGENTS.md, .agents/settings.json, its skills and agents. No new top-bar page."},{"label":"A Workspaces page","description":"A new top-bar page listing each workspace with its repository, settings and charter."}]},{"question":"Which pages hold the rules?","header":"Pages","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Constraints and Capabilities (Recommended)","description":"Two pages. Capabilities holds what the agent may use and the permissions (grants, ask or allowed). Each page has two views: Global, where an item is on or off everywhere, and Workflows, where you pick the workflows and steps it applies to.","preview":"Capabilities   [Global | Workflows]\n\nsandbox::fs::read      Ask|Allowed\n  Applies to:\n  ☑ Bug fix      ☑ plan  ☐ build\n  ☐ Short\n  ☑ Research     (every step)"},{"label":"Three pages","description":"Constraints, Capabilities and Permissions, each with the Global and Workflows views."}]},{"question":"What does a workflow step show about its rules?","header":"Step panel","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"A read-only list (Recommended)","description":"The step's panel lists the rules that apply at it, with a link to each one's page to change where it applies. Editing lives on the rules pages only."},{"label":"Nothing","description":"The step panel has no rules at all; the rules pages are the only place to see them."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":892,"cache_read_input_tokens":944479,"output_tokens":1586,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":620},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":892,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1586,"cache_read_input_tokens":944479,"cache_creation_input_tokens":892,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":892},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01ENaQpb4NgQa4TX2wj3yTbF":{"questions":[{"question":"Does Bastion still apply the charter (the repository's deny rules and hooks), or only show it?","header":"Charter","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Only show it","description":"Bastion stops applying the repository's permissions and hooks; only Bastion's own rules govern a job. The charter becomes a read-only view of what the repository holds. The agent may still read AGENTS.md as part