{"parentUuid":"dd1bbb49-dfd3-4665-992c-477456e79e75","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgydXHZjdEnX3sBDei5N8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The new pages now apply rules to workflows and steps. The Workflows page shows the rules but has no forms. I made two commits, and neither is pushed:\n\n- **0c0bc1e (P1):** Constraints, Capabilities and Permissions are back in the top bar. Permissions has a lock icon. Each page has two views:\n  - **Global** turns an item on or off for every workflow.\n  - **Workflows** shows \"on at N of M steps\" for each item. Its Where button opens a list of each workflow and its steps, each with Inherit | On | Off.\n- **f5fb5c2 (P3):** The Workflows page no longer has the level bar or the every-step panel. A step's \"Rules · N\" tab now lists its constraints, capabilities and permissions, read-only. Each section has a \"Change on …\" link to its page. VISION.md and PLAN.md now say this.\n\n**Checks:**\n- I tested it in the app. I set \"Keep every assertion a test makes.\" On at Bug fix › build, and the count went from 0 to 1 of 52 steps. Then I set it back to Inherit, and the server shows `['!*']` again.\n- The read-only list showed on the plan step, and its Permissions link opened that page.\n- fmt, seams, clippy `-D warnings` and every test pass. The CodeScene safeguard passed before each commit.\n\n**What does not show now:** The charter (AGENTS.md, the repository's allow rules and hooks, its skills and agents) no longer appears in any rules view. Bastion still applies it. P2 puts it on a read-only Workspaces page, and that is the next step."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":290,"cache_read_input_tokens":203683,"output_tokens":733,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":208},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":290,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":733,"cache_read_input_tokens":203683,"cache_creation_input_tokens":290,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":290},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1616544b-0e60-4f99-a732-ed0676f005e4","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgydXHFPxq7ZpuP1Pykaa","type":"assistant","uuid":"9922eda7-2264-43ae-9db0-ad2e640e8b6e","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:02:13.532Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
