{"parentUuid":"d153ef76-e4de-4434-9175-a00e57e1b79e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"50f3cf6a-f18b-4b70-b233-30aa8facc040","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qtm1j83jkuJCN1LEohWRmr","type":"tool_result","content":"## Two levels: each server, and all of them\n\nEvery page shows one server, the one you pick at the top. Some pages can\nalso show every server at once, and those are the ones about records.\n\n**Records, per server or across all.** Jobs, Audit Log, Costs, Evals and\nVerification read one server, or every server you added, side by side. All\nservers is one more choice in the server picker, so you filter by server the\nsame way on each of these pages. You open a job, an entry or a turn and act\non it wherever it lives.\n\n**Rules, one server at a time.** Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities,\nPermissions, Engine and Settings belong to the server you pick. Each rules\npage applies an item to the steps and workflows you select, and a step's\nRules tab lists what applies there. A rules page never mixes two servers,\nbecause each server's rules shape only its own jobs, and a sum of two rule\nsets means nothing.\n\n## What a server holds","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"40e07293-5bf4-49db-aef5-44880e62a354","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:12:23.138Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Two levels: each server, and all of them\n\nEvery page shows one server, the one you pick at the top. Some pages can\nalso show every server at once, and those are the ones about records.\n\n**Records, per server or across all.** Jobs, Audit Log, Costs, Evals and\nVerification read one server, or every server you added, side by side. All\nservers is one more choice in the server picker, so you filter by server the\nsame way on each of these pages. You open a job, an entry or a turn and act\non it wherever it lives.\n\n**Rules, one server at a time.** Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities,\nPermissions, Engine and Settings belong to the server you pick. Each 