{"parentUuid":"4de3452a-2475-4bd8-98aa-65aa3fb9b913","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyeKdsACPADu1QDHyBb3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":514,"cache_read_input_tokens":213892,"output_tokens":959,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":213},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":514,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":959,"cache_read_input_tokens":213892,"cache_creation_input_tokens":514,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":514},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e4d0c8f0-15a7-4d01-a542-e4b6343db1df","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgyeKdTMMGYviNhS9k2hc","type":"assistant","uuid":"aa33cef8-82aa-435e-96d7-f4f8f9282bd0","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:12:43.384Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
{"parentUuid":"aa33cef8-82aa-435e-96d7-f4f8f9282bd0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyeKdsACPADu1QDHyBb3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I updated the vision. The push is still running in the background, and I'll report when it ends.\n\n**VISION.md changes:**\n- **Lede:** Bastion is a control plane. On each server it manages a harness and a factory: rules, agents, skills, hooks and grants, plus the workflows that run them.\n- **New section, \"The harness and the factory\":** You manage each item in the app.\n  - You promote or demote it: feedforward or feedback for a rule, ask or allowed for a grant.\n  - You turn it on or off.\n  - You apply it to one step, a workflow's steps, some workflows, or all workflows.\n- **No global rules:** \"All workflows\" is only a selection. An item with no selection applies nowhere.\n- **New section, \"A workspace's charter\":** Charter items apply only to that workspace's jobs. A step can use them, and you edit them in the app. An edit changes the file in the repository, and an agent's turn still can't change the charter.\n- **\"Every page: all servers, or one\":** I took your message to mean every page, not only Workspaces. Each page shows all servers side by side, or the one you pick. On All servers, each row names its server, and a change goes to that server only. The Workspaces page shows each workspace and its charter.\n\n**DECISIONS.md:** The new D58 records this. It replaces D57's Global view with \"All workflows\", and it ends D53's rule that only record pages span servers.\n\nvoice-check reports two findings. The triads are data lists, so I left them. It also wants one first-person aside, such as why nothing is global. I didn't invent your reason, so give me one if you want it there. Neither file is committed yet.\n\n**Code that must change to match:**\n1. An item with no selection applies nowhere. Today, a list with no positive token means every step. A migration has to write `*` onto the items that rely on that default, so their behavior stays the same.\n2. The \"Global\" view becomes \"All workflows\".\n3. The Workspaces page needs both views, all servers and one server. Charter edits need a new API that writes the file into the repository.\n4. The rules pages need the All servers view, with the server named on each row.\n\nTwo of my assumptions need a yes or no:\n- Should rules pages also aggregate across servers, or only Workspaces?\n- Should a charter edit commit to the repository, or only change the working tree?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":514,"cache_read_input_tokens":213892,"output_tokens":959,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":213},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":514,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":959,"cache_read_input_tokens":213892,"cache_creation_input_tokens":514,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":514},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e4d0c8f0-15a7-4d01-a542-e4b6343db1df","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgyeKdTMMGYviNhS9k2hc","type":"assistant","uuid":"fc636bb6-f71c-4f04-a18b-2696343cf4db","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:12:44.398Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
