{"parentUuid":"ad015c66-2485-4825-85e6-f793946a7089","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyeSwEdUwFLRBr7XCSzJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I stopped because the disk is full. Every Bash call fails with `ENOSPC: no space left on device`, and file writes will fail too.\n\nThe likely cause is `target/`, because each desktop rebuild used `CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0`. `cargo clean` deletes only build output, and the next build makes it again. Run this:\n\n```\n! cd /Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion && cargo clean && df -h /\n```\n\nThis is the plan I'll write into PLAN.md once there is space:\n\n- **S1. Nothing is global (D58).**\n  - An item with no selection applies nowhere. Today, a list with no positive token means every step. I'll change that default in core `on_at` and in desktop `scope.rs`.\n  - `set_scope` stops writing the inherited `*`, because inheriting now means off.\n  - Migration 10 prepends `*` to every constraint `steps` list and grant `scopes` list that has no positive token and no `!*`. That keeps today's behavior. Seeds get explicit `*`.\n  - The \"Global\" view becomes \"All workflows\". I'll add tests for the new default and for the migration.\n- **S2. Rules pages across all servers.**\n  - On All servers, each rules page shows one section per server, with the server named.\n  - A change goes to that section's server, through a context that points at it.\n  - `Route::records()` covers the rules pages too.\n- **S3. The Workspaces page.**\n  - It lists each workspace and its charter: AGENTS.md, allow rules, hooks, skills and agents.\n  - It shows all servers or one, with a folder icon.\n- **S4. Charter edits in the app.**\n  - You edit a charter file in the app.\n  - The server commits the edit to a new branch in the workspace's repository, such as `bastion/charter-<n>`, and never to the base branch.\n  - An agent's turn still can't change the charter.\n- **Docs.** D58 gets \"charter edits commit to a branch\". VISION.md says the rules pages aggregate too.\n\nI'll start S1 once the disk has space."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":242,"cache_read_input_tokens":223168,"output_tokens":880,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":199},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":242,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":880,"cache_read_input_tokens":223168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":242,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":242},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bd8e5e61-c9f3-404f-82f5-0fba90247eb3","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgyeSvu2aePuyvcQExvoi","type":"assistant","uuid":"c2f6b1ad-5f75-4dcf-a8a6-beb89592fdae","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:14:22.341Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-server/src","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
