{"parentUuid":"bd28cfa1-36f0-4cc4-800f-bae56f8cdad4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f535196d-21bb-4bca-969d-6fc93351fcb1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WJpQ3yLgp7XtDEeWKfhTks","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/0ab05991-cb70-43bb-a07e-4dec47dd82cf.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/4e279253-a1ef-48c0-9838-f53383068502.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/56d6e7b1-96ea-4c7d-9513-9f0158e6277b.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/8302652e-dbf8-495c-95ed-4cb13980c4b0.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/88f0e540-f0c1-4132-a7bc-4002f8ada093.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/9a0a29bf-b0da-4b97-8739-2b29ca6ee445.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/c3e38517-6d5a-49ad-b899-fecb5525cb41.jsonl\nugrep: error: error at position 655\n\\x8f][\\x80-\\xbf][\\x80-\\xbf]){0,120}\n      exceeds complexity limits___/\n\n\n---\nname: bastion-dev-workflow\ndescription: \"How Bastion is built and exercised — phase-by-phase, browser-verified dev loop\"\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: e12abe44-53cd-4a89-8523-1de294a7c4aa\n---\n\nBastion = commercial multi-tenant cloud AI-governance platform (the paid cloud\nversion of `~/tacoda/open-refinery`, which is single-tenant/VPS). Built in\nnumbered phases tracked in `PLAN.md`; each phase gets its own stacked branch off\n`main` (phase-0 → 1 → 2 → 2b → 3 → 6a-thin-ui …), committed but left unmerged.\n\n**User wants to exercise changes in the browser as they're implemented** — not\njust tests. Standing dev loop:\n- API + postgres + redis run in Docker (`make up`); ports web 5173, api 8000,\n  pg 5432, redis 6379.\n- Frontend runs **locally via `bun run dev`** (Vite hot reload) — stop the\n  `web` container first to free 5173. Faster than rebuilding the image per edit.\n- `make test` = unit/api (no DB); `make test-int` = integration (needs pg+redis,\n  migrations applied via `uv run alembic upgrade head`).\n\nStack: FastAPI + LangGraph (uv), React+Vite+TS+Tailwind v4 (bun), Postgres\n(shared-DB + RLS multi-tenancy), Redis (Celery + sessions + device grants),\nports-and-adapters. Styling rule: Tailwind **semantic @apply classes**, never\ninline utility soup; shadcn allowed but wrapped. See [[bastion-conventions]].","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e4cc2d09-ac35-4065-af33-00af611fb2d3","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:18:33.728Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/0ab05991-cb70-43bb-a07e-4dec47dd82cf.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/4e279253-a1ef-48c0-9838-f53383068502.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/56d6e7b1-96ea-4c7d-9513-9f0158e6277b.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/8302652e-dbf8-495c-95ed-4cb13980c4b0.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/88f0e540-f0c1-4132-a7bc-4002f8ada093.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/9a0a29bf-b0da-4b97-8739-2b29ca6ee445.jsonl\n/Users/tacoda/.claude/projects/-Users-tacoda-tacoda-bastion/c3e38517-6d5a-49ad-b899-fecb5525cb41.jsonl\nugrep: error: error at position 655\n\\x8f][\\x80-\\xbf][\\x80-\\xbf]){0,120}\n      exceeds complexity limits___/\n\n\n---\nname: bastion-dev-workflow\ndescription: \"How Bastion is built and exercised — phase-by-phase, browser-verified dev loop\"\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: e12abe44-53cd-4a89-8523-1de294a7c4aa\n---\n\nBastion = commercial multi-tenant cloud AI-governance platform (the paid cloud\nversion of `~/tacoda/open-refinery`, which is single-tenant/VPS). Built in\nnumbered phases tracked in `PLAN.md`; each phase gets its own stacked branch off\n`main` (phase-0 → 1 → 2 → 2b → 3 → 6a-thin-ui …), committed but left unmerged.\n\n**User wants to exercise changes in the browser as they're implemented** — not\njust tests. Standing dev loop:\n- API + postgres + redis run in Docker (`make up`); ports web 5173, api 8000,\n  pg 5432, redis 6379.\n- Frontend runs **locally via `bun run dev`** (Vite hot reload) — stop the\n  `web` container first to free 5173. Faster than rebuilding the image per edit.\n- `make test` = unit/api (no DB); `make test-int` = integration (needs pg+redis,\n  migrations applied via `uv run alembic upgrade head`).\n\nStack: FastAPI + LangGraph (uv), React+Vite+TS+Tailwind v4 (bun), Postgres\n(shared-DB + RLS multi-tenancy), Redis (Celery + sessions + device grants),\nports-and-adapters. Styling rule: Tailwind **semantic @apply classes**, never\ninline utility soup; shadcn allowed but wrapped. See [[bastion-conventions]].","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"774adacf-86f9-4793-a97e-4e85f0758c0b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":12,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bd28cfa1-36f0-4cc4-800f-bae56f8cdad4","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoin