{"parentUuid":"f35c979b-ff30-44af-b2f2-8b2aec63e4d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgyf4xs6ijxPXeESaExrd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"S1 is committed as 77d458a and not pushed. I stopped before S2 because only 834Mi of disk is left. This round of builds used about 3.5Gi, and the next build will fail with ENOSPC.\n\n**What S1 changed:**\n- **Core and desktop:** An item with no selection now applies nowhere. `set_scope` no longer writes the inherited `*`.\n- **Migration 10:** I checked its SQL in sqlite3 first. On the live server, it gave `*` to every list that selected nothing: `clean-tree`, `commit-work`, `keep-tests`, `no-curl`, `no-login-shell`, `no-secrets`, and the agent, shell and skill grants. The `!*` lists and the selected lists did not change, so every item works as it did before.\n- **New items:** A rule or grant made at All workflows now carries `*`. The old desktop sent an empty step for a grant, which would now mean nowhere. Charter rules and approved-test rules also carry `*`.\n- **Desktop:** The \"Global\" view is now \"All workflows\".\n- **Docs:** VISION.md, D58 (charter edits commit to a new branch, never the base) and PLAN.md (S1 to S4) are in the same commit.\n- **Checks:** fmt, seams, clippy and every test pass. The CodeScene safeguard passed. I checked the change in the app after a restart of the local server.\n\nI also changed one scratchpad file. `scratchpad/api.sh` now reads the token folder from the `local-server` pointer file, because the dev-build server keeps its token in `data/server`.\n\n**Before S2:** Free more disk space. `cargo clean` frees only a little, because the rebuild fills it again. Space must come from outside `target/`. I need about 5Gi free. Tell me when there is space, and I'll start S2 (the rules pages across all servers)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":302,"cache_read_input_tokens":277339,"output_tokens":640,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":26},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":302,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":640,"cache_read_input_tokens":277339,"cache_creation_input_tokens":302,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":302},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1c621d27-62d2-4aa0-ab28-5bc0ad7fdeec","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgyf4xZVpUoqpPBvGZEyN","type":"assistant","uuid":"4d08a2d2-d087-492e-a8f2-4bc55d664277","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:22:28.682Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
