{"parentUuid":"079a9188-7c2e-438e-ba4d-36f956470ddc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyfPQi7kByNAMpMCTnZQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YEVhifcN2kTpkQSCJ4hZWV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"### S2.\"); j=s.index(\"## Open questions\")\ns=s[:i]+'''### S2. Two homes: Workflows and Workspaces\n\nEverything a job runs under belongs to a workflow or to a workspace, so\nthe top bar loses Constraints, Capabilities and Permissions.\n\n- Workflows gets tabs: Steps, Constraints, Capabilities and Permissions.\n  The rules pages become its tabs, unchanged.\n- A Workspaces page joins the top bar. It holds each workspace's settings\n  and accounts, moved from Settings, and its charter, read-only for now:\n  AGENTS.md, its allow and ask rules, its hooks, its skills and agents.\n- Settings keeps what belongs to the server itself: servers, people,\n  model providers, MCP servers, the factory, notifications and history.\n\n### S3. Workflows and Workspaces across all servers\n\n- On All servers, each tab shows one section per server, named.\n- A change goes to its section's server.\n\n### S4. Charter edits\n\n- Edit a charter file in the app. The server commits the edit on a new\n  branch of the workspace's repository, never on its base branch.\n- An agent's turn still may not change the charter.\n\n'''+s[j:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nv=open('VISION.md').read()\na='''- **What runs:** Workspaces, Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities and\n  Permissions. The Workspaces page shows each workspace and its charter.\n  Each rules page applies an item to the steps and workflows you select,\n  and a step's Rules tab lists what applies there.'''\nassert a in v\nv=v.replace(a,'''- **What runs:** Workflows and Workspaces. Workflows holds the steps and\n  three tabs of rules: Constraints, Capabilities and Permissions. Each\n  rules tab applies an item to the steps and workflows you select, and a\n  step's Rules tab lists what applies there. Workspaces holds each\n  workspace's settings and its charter.''')\nopen('VISION.md','w').write(v)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"Constraints, Capabilities\" VISION.md","description":"Update plan S2-S4 and vision pages"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2276,"cache_read_input_tokens":280467,"output_tokens":1719,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":858},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2276,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1719,"cache_read_input_tokens":280467,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2276,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2276},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01YEVhifcN2kTpkQSCJ4hZWV":{"command":"cd /Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"### S2.\"); j=s.index(\"## Open questions\")\ns=s[:i]+'''### S2. Two homes: Workflows and Workspaces\n\nEverything a job runs under belongs to a workflow or to a workspace, so\nthe top bar loses Constraints, Capabilities and Permissions.\n\n- Workflows gets tabs: Steps, Constraints, Capabilities and Permissions.\n  The rules pages become its tabs, unchanged.\n- A Workspaces page joins the top bar. It holds each workspace's settings\n  and accounts, moved from Settings, and its charter, read-only for now:\n  AGENTS.md, its allow and ask rules, its hooks, its skills and agents.\n- Settings keeps what belongs to the server itself: servers, people,\n  model providers, MCP servers, the factory, notifications and history.\n\n### S3. Workflows and Workspaces across all servers\n\n- On All servers, each tab shows one section per server, named.\n- A change goes to its section's server.\n\n### S4. Charter edits\n\n- Edit a charter file in the app. The server commits the edit on a new\n  branch of the workspace's repository, never on its base branch.\n- An agent's turn still may not change the charter.\n\n'''+s[j:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nv=open('VISION.md').read()\na='''- **What runs:** Workspaces, Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities and\n  Permissions. The Workspaces page shows each workspace and its charter.\n  Each rules page applies an item to the steps and workflows you select,\n  and a step's Rules tab lists what applies there.'''\nassert a in v\nv=v.replace(a,'''- **What runs:** Workflows and Workspaces. Workflows holds the steps and\n  three tabs of rules: Constraints, Capabilities and Permissions. Each\n  rules tab applies an item to the steps and workflows you select, and a\n  step's Rules tab lists what applies there. Workspaces holds each\n  workspace's settings and its charter.''')\nopen('VISION.md','w').write(v)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"Constraints, Capabilities\" VISION.md","description":"Update plan S2-S4 and vision pages"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"1e1976bf-00e2-46a7-989c-6fef99244076","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgyfPQRFp6EYLEJA3KYd2","type":"assistant","uuid":"527eb818-3188-4750-8fde-f69686e81d2b","timestamp":"2026-11-12T20:26:47.978Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/crates/bastion-desktop/src/pages/settings","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
